# Alembic migrations

## Apply all schema (initial + incremental)

```bash
cd backend
python -m alembic upgrade head
```

## Revision chain

| Revision | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `20260602_0001` | users |
| `20260602_0002` | conversations |
| `20260602_0003` | messages (partitioned) + archive |
| `20260602_0004` | tickets + status rules |

## Rollback (one step)

```bash
python -m alembic downgrade -1
python -m alembic downgrade 20260602_0003
python -m alembic downgrade base
```

SQL rollbacks: `backend/db/rollback/`

## Helpers

- `scripts/db/migrate.ps1 upgrade|downgrade|current|history`
- `scripts/db/migrate.sh upgrade|downgrade|current|history`
